    "detailed_description": "Umbral Core is a 2.5D fighting game set in a world of dark high fantasy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmidst the darkness and depravity of a twisted world lies the namesake of the game, the Umbral Core. An artefact of a bygone era; perpetuating the cycle of suffering for generations to come.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUmbral Core's art direction aims at a stylized dark fantasy addition to the fighting game genre. The inspiration was pulled from ranges to that of Eldritch horror, to the more traditional grim dark fantasy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe initial roster includes 8 characters with unique, deep and complex designs. All relevant fighting archetypes are represented throughout the roster in order to appeal to all kinds of playstyles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features rollback netcode, uncapped FPS, engaging combat mechanics for players across all skill levels, lots of customization options and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame modes will include story mode, online/offline versus and training, tutorial, trials and more.",
    "about_the_game": "Umbral Core is a 2.5D fighting game set in a world of dark high fantasy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAmidst the darkness and depravity of a twisted world lies the namesake of the game, the Umbral Core. An artefact of a bygone era; perpetuating the cycle of suffering for generations to come.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUmbral Core's art direction aims at a stylized dark fantasy addition to the fighting game genre. The inspiration was pulled from ranges to that of Eldritch horror, to the more traditional grim dark fantasy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe initial roster includes 8 characters with unique, deep and complex designs. All relevant fighting archetypes are represented throughout the roster in order to appeal to all kinds of playstyles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features rollback netcode, uncapped FPS, engaging combat mechanics for players across all skill levels, lots of customization options and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame modes will include story mode, online/offline versus and training, tutorial, trials and more.",
    "short_description": "Umbral Core is a 2.5D fighting game set in a world of dark high fantasy. It features rollback netcode, uncapped FPS, engaging combat mechanics for players across all skill levels and lots of customization options.",
